@startuml m3-service-interactions
title Generate an architecture draft
actor Human
participant "masd-web" as Web
participant "Project Service" as PS
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Agent Service" as AS
participant "LLM Gateway" as GW
Human -> Web : Generate architecture
Web -> PS : POST commands:stream {generate, expected_version}\nIdempotency-Key
PS -> DB : authorize, verify source PRD, claim operation, commit
PS -> AS : architect/run (approved PRD snapshot, prior package, model route)
AS -> GW : completions (bounded, structured)
GW --> AS : output + actual model + usage (if returned)
AS --> PS : validated package + findings + execution metadata
PS -> DB : re-validate, append revision, release operation, commit
PS --> Web : SSE saved {session view}
Web --> Human : draft rendered (C4, sections, traceability)
@enduml
